  (text "Pico W  ->  Arduino Alvik adapter (replaces the Nano ESP32)" (at 25.4 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid be87543c-d74a-5a9c-b27b-69a26971db3a)
  )
  (text "Pico W is reflow/hand soldered by its castellated pads on TOP.\nNano-footprint 2x15 SMD male headers on BOTTOM plug into the Alvik.\nNet names = Nano pin name + Alvik function." (at 25.4 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid b66a1fa1-6347-522f-8db0-482add0f7161)
  )
  (text "Nano pin -> Pico GPIO   (Alvik use)\n  D1 (J1.1 ) -> GP20  (U1.26)  Alvik: UART TX -> STM32 RX | Pico UART1 TX\n  D0 (J1.2 ) -> GP21  (U1.27)  Alvik: UART RX <- STM32 TX | Pico UART1 RX\n  D2 (J1.5 ) -> GP22  (U1.29)  Alvik: STM32 BOOT0\n  D3 (J1.6 ) -> GP26  (U1.31)  Alvik: STM32 NRST\n  D4 (J1.7 ) -> GP27  (U1.32)  Alvik: NANO_CHK (EXT_CHK)\n  A4 (J1.23) -> GP6   (U1.9 )  Alvik: I2C SDA (Qwiic/Grove) | Pico I2C1 SDA\n  A5 (J1.24) -> GP7   (U1.10)  Alvik: I2C SCL (Qwiic/Grove) | Pico I2C1 SCL\n  A6 (J1.25) -> GP8   (U1.11)  Alvik: ROBOT_CHK input\n  D5 (J1.8 ) -> GP28  (U1.34)  Pico ADC2\n D13 (J1.16) -> GP1   (U1.2 )  \n  A0 (J1.19) -> GP2   (U1.4 )  \n  A1 (J1.20) -> GP3   (U1.5 )  \n  A2 (J1.21) -> GP4   (U1.6 )  \n  A3 (J1.22) -> GP5   (U1.7 )  \n  A7 (J1.26) -> GP9   (U1.12)  " (at 210.82 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid d3f356a2-9e57-565a-9904-12fc9fa14d6b)
  )
  (text "POWER\nAlvik: VUSB pin = power/charge INPUT (from the controller's USB),\n       VIN pin  = Alvik power OUTPUT to the controller.\nUSB plugged:   Pico VBUS -> Nano VUSB pin (direct)       (powers/charges the Alvik)\n               Pico VBUS -> on-board Schottky -> VSYS    (powers the Pico)\nUSB unplugged: Alvik VIN -> D1 -> VSYS                    (Alvik powers the Pico)\nD1 keeps USB-derived VSYS from back-feeding the Alvik VIN output; the two\nsources are diode-OR'ed on VSYS. Option: 1206 0R in D1 (Nano-like, no isolation).\nVSYS 1.8-5.5 V.\nJP2 (bridged): Pico 3V3(OUT) -> Nano 3V3 pin = Alvik +3V3_EXT. Load < 300 mA.\nJP3 (open): Nano RST -> Pico RUN.  Nano B0/B1, D8-D12: not connected." (at 160.02 142.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 960d7365-d390-52f9-a209-bd2832b06a62)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
